  "title": "Contango Announces Listing on Toronto Stock Exchange",
  "summary": "FAIRBANKS, Alaska and VANCOUVER, BC, April 13, 2026 – Contango Silver & Gold Inc. (“Contango” or the “Company”) (NYSE American: CTGO) (TSX: CTGO) is pleased to announce that its shares of common stock (“Common Shares”) have been approved for listing on the Toronto Stock Exchange (”TSX”) and have been posted for trading on the TSX effective April 13, 2026, […]",
